{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 41, "data": [{"docid2": 2221303, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260618_2221303.htm", "content": "　　6月13日至14日，三明市2026年民营企业开放日暨高校毕业生三明行活动在全市7个县（市、区）同步启动，吸引了闽南理工学院、泉州轻工职业学院、三明学院、福州大学至诚学院等省内4所高校的200余名师生参与。\n　　这", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260618_2221303.htm", "docreltime": "2026.06.18 09:09:00", "doctitle": "我市举办民营企业开放日暨高校毕业生三明行活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2433706, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260618_2221303.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2206200, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/t20260510_2206200.htm", "content": "　　5月9日，2026年三明市“职引未来——高校毕业生专场”暨“就业帮扶·暖心送岗”国有企业残疾人专场招聘会在三明爱琴海购物中心广场举办。\n　　本次招聘会由市人社局、市国资委、市残联联合主办，聚焦应往届残疾高", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/t20260510_2206200.htm", "docreltime": "2026.05.10 09:52:00", "doctitle": "我市举办高校毕业生暨国有企业残疾人专场招聘会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2417236, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/t20260510_2206200.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2203981, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202604/t20260427_2203981.htm", "content": "　　4月22日，三明学院经济与管理学院联合永春县举办永春企业招才引智推介会暨现场招聘活动。16家永春优质企业代表走进三明学院，带来百余个优质岗位。\n　　招聘现场氛围热烈，人头攒动。企业通过宣传片展示、现场宣", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202604/t20260427_2203981.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.27 09:21:00", "doctitle": "三明学院举办永春企业招才引智推介会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2414679, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202604/t20260427_2203981.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2192118, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260303_2192118.htm", "content": "　　商场外围，细雨飘洒；红色帐篷，人头攒动。\n　　3月2日，三明爱琴海购物中心露天广场上，招聘展位整齐排列，企业宣传展板有序摆放，40家企业、538个岗位在此虚位以待，求职者们手持简历，穿梭于人流之中，驻足咨", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260303_2192118.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.03 08:45:00", "doctitle": "2026年三明市春风行动暨就业助援季专场招聘会侧记", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2400969, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260303_2192118.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2167688, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202511/t20251107_2167688.htm", "content": "\n　　11月6日，三明市体育馆集散广场人头攒动，2025年金秋招聘月“金秋送岗·职在林博”专场招聘会在此举行。\n　　上午9时，招聘会正式启动，60家企业的招聘展位依次排开，入口展板上的900余个招聘岗位，涵盖机械制造", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202511/t20251107_2167688.htm", "docreltime": "2025.11.07 09:51:00", "doctitle": "我市举办“金秋送岗·职在林博”专场招聘会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2371616, 