, "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1800634, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202108/t20210802_1689833.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202108/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1659820, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jycy/jyzxhd/202104/t20210430_1659820.htm", "content": "\n　　4月28日，由中共三明市委人才办、三明市人力资源和社会保障局、三明学院联合主办的“风展红旗·才聚三明”2021年专场推介活动在三明学院举行。 \n　　校地携手，服务三明发展 \n　　“风展红旗·才聚三明”梅列区", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/t20210430_1659820.htm", "docreltime": "2021.04.30 16:16:00", "doctitle": "“风展红旗 才聚三明”三明学院专场推介会顺利召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1762670, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/t20210430_1659820.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "U020210430586860115590.jpg", "appdocid": 1659820, "appfile": "W020210430587155097294.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/t20210430_1659820.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202104/W020210430/W020210430587155097294.jpg", "_href": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/W020210430587155097294.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/", "_firstpic": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/W020210430587155097294.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1659809, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jycy/jyzxhd/202104/t20210430_1659809.htm", "content": "\n　　为推进梅列区康养职业技能培训，助力三明“森林康养基地”建设，提升康养服务人员技能水平，推动康养事业持续健康发展，4月28日上午，梅列区职业技能鉴定指导中心在三明市创业职业培训学校举办2021年首期育婴员", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/t20210430_1659809.htm", "docreltime": "2021.04.30 16:12:00", "doctitle": "梅列区2021年首期育婴员公益性培训班开班", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1762671, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/t20210430_1659809.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1659261, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jycy/jyzxhd/202104/t20210429_1659261.htm", "content": "\n　　为切实帮助企业解决“招工难”问题，建宁县人社局开展以“就业帮扶，真情相助”为主题的线上就业援助活动，通过线上求职招聘系统于第一季度发布五场线上招聘会，共35家企业提供1000余个就业岗位，达成就业意向8", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/t20210429_1659261.htm", "docreltime": "2021.04.29 14:59:00", "doctitle": "建宁县线上招聘常态化 持续送岗不停歇", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1762673, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/t20210429_1659261.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202104/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1632402, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202102/t20210208_1632402.htm", "content": "\n　　连日来，我市组织开展“迎新春送温暖、稳岗留工”专项行动，鼓励、支持务工人员留明过年，为用人单位提供用工保障，确保员工健康安全、企业生产有序、就业形势总体稳定。 \n　　我市强化就业优先政策，出台春节期", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202102/t20210208_1632402.htm", "docreltime": "2021.02.08 11:45:00", "doctitle": "我市开展“迎新春送温暖、稳岗留工”专项行动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1729245, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202102/t20210208_1632402.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202102/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1569756, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202009/t20200915_1569756.htm", "content": "\n　　广大用人单位和求职者： \n　　经研究决定，三明市人力资源市场自2020年9月23日起将恢复举办每周三(除节假日外)的现场招聘会，现将有关事项公告如下： \n　　一、招聘会时间：每周三上午9:00—17:00。 \n　　二、招", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202009/t20200915_1569756.htm", "docreltime": "2020.09.15 11:01:00", "doctitle": "关于三明市人力资源市场恢复举办现场招聘会的公告", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1667572, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202009/t20200915_1569756.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202009/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1556375, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202008/t20200804_1556375.htm", "content": "\n　　8月1日上午，由三元区人社局联合四个部门主办，三元区城关街道党工委、办事处联合两个部门承办，在腾飞广场举办了以“‘职’在民企‘就’有未来”为主题的暖心送岗专场招聘会，为高校毕业生、退役军人、残疾人、", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202008/t20200804_1556375.htm", "docreltime": "2020.08.04 17:29:00", "doctitle": "三元区举办2020年“‘职’在民企‘就’有未来”暖心送岗专场招聘会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1647986, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202008/t20200804_1556375.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "U020200804630342303417.jpg", "appdocid": 1556375, "appfile": "W020200804630396494358.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202008/t20200804_1556375.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202008/W020200804/W020200804630396494358.jpg", "_href": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202008/W020200804630396494358.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202008/", "_firstpic": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202008/W020200804630396494358.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1554380, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200728_1554380.htm", "content": "\n　　7月26日，“梅列区2020年“职”在民企“就”有未来暨助企用工专场招聘会”在东方伟业城市广场圆满落幕。本次专场招聘会为公益性质，首次使用“线上直播+现场洽谈”模式，提高了招聘会实效。\n　　线上招聘会通过", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200728_1554380.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.28 16:53:00", "doctitle": "梅列区2020年“职”在民企“就”有未来暨助企用工专场招聘会圆满落幕", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1647985, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200728_1554380.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "U020200728608376852154.jpg", "appdocid": 1554380, "appfile": "W020200728609468471729.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200728_1554380.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202007/W020200728/W020200728609468471729.jpg", "_href": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/W020200728609468471729.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/", "_firstpic": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/W020200728609468471729.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1552843, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200722_1552843.htm", "content": "\n　　为促进本地求职者充分就业，缓解因疫情导致的用工困难，助力企业顺利复工复产。7月21日上午，泰宁县人社局在市民广场举办“‘职’在民企，‘就’有未来”2020年民营企业专场招聘会。 \n　　本次招聘会以民营企业", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200722_1552843.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.22 11:55:00", "doctitle": "泰宁县举行2020年民营企业专场招聘会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1647984, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200722_1552843.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "U020200722430350729030.png", "appdocid": 1552843, "appfile": "W020200722430392846347.png", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200722_1552843.htm", "fileext": "png", "_src": "/webpic/W0202007/W020200722/W020200722430392846347.png", "_href": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/W020200722430392846347.png"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/", "_firstpic": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/W020200722430392846347.png", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1552841, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200722_1552841.htm", "content": "\n　　7月21日早上，尤溪县人社局、中国海峡人才市场尤溪分部在县府前广场举办2020年大中专毕业生专场招聘会。本次招聘活动有24家参会单位，提供就业岗位166个，招聘需求总人数1300余个。本次招聘会参展企业涵盖制造业", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200722_1552841.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.22 11:54:00", "doctitle": "尤溪县举办2020年大中专毕业生专场招聘会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1647983, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200722_1552841.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1550505, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200713_1550505.htm", "content": "\n　　7月10日晚，将乐县人力资源和社会保障局、中国海峡人才市场将乐分部在十字街喷泉广场共同举办2020年将乐县返乡高校毕业生专场招聘会。此次招聘会重点面向离校未就业高校毕业生及各类有求职意愿的人员。17家企业", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200713_1550505.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.13 17:23:00", "doctitle": "将乐县举办返乡高校毕业生专场招聘会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1647982, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/t20200713_1550505.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202007/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1468745, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202001/t20200120_1468745.htm", "content": "\n　　为促进龙海市与我县山海协作对口帮扶工作，积极推动我县农村劳动力转移特别是贫困人口就业。1月16日上午，龙海市人社局和泰宁县人社局在泰宁县市民广场举办2020年龙海·泰宁山海协作暨就业专场招聘会。\n　　本次", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202001/t20200120_1468745.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.20 16:06:00", "doctitle": "龙海泰宁两地联合举办2020年山海协作暨就业专场招聘会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1647981, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202001/t20200120_1468745.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1264757, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "就业专项活动", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/201902/t20190201_1264757.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）人力资源和社会保障局、残疾人联合会：\n　　现将《福建省人力资源和社会保障厅 福建省残疾人联合会关于开展2019年就业援助月专项活动的通知》（闽人社文〔2019〕2号）转发给你们，现结合我市实际", "docabstract": "开展2019年就业援助月专项活动", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/201902/t20190201_1264757.ht